msgstr ""
"FLEXRamp 类型A1\n"
"\n"
"支持RHW-2 (L0-L2)、RHW-3 (L0-L2)、MIS (L0-L4)、RHW-4 (L0-L4和DDRHW-4)、RHW-6S(仅L0，因悬挑)、RHW-6C (L0-L2)、RHW-8S (L0-L2)、RHW-8C (L0-L2)、RHW-10S (L0-L2)、RHW-12S (L0-L2)"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-5780001F"
